Package: lenzu-models-dbnet
Version: 0.2.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: lenzu
Maintainer: Hideki A. Ikeda <hideki.ikeda@exactasystems.com>
Homepage: https://huggingface.co/StabRise/text_detection_dbnet_ml_v0.2
Description: DBNet text-detection ONNX model for Lenzu (AGPL-3.0)
 Pre-trained DBNet text-detection model from
 StabRise/text_detection_dbnet_ml_v0.2 on Hugging Face, exported to ONNX.
 Used by lenzu for pre-OCR text region detection.
 .
 This package is licensed under AGPL-3.0 (NOT MIT). It is shipped
 separately so the main 'lenzu' MIT package remains free of copyleft
 obligations. Installing this package is optional: lenzu falls back to
 full-image OCR when the model is not present.
